  "Hi, my name is Lan. I am twenty-four years old, and I live in Hanoi with my family. I work in a small office near my home. I usually get up at six o'clock and have breakfast at home. I go to work by bus. In the evening, I cook dinner and spend time with my family. I go to bed at about eleven o'clock.": "/audio/tts/908b18380a1dd8888d3b.mp3?v=1",
  "Holistic approach": "/audio/tts/fd5aa84aaa0e9f685d1d.mp3?v=1",
  "I am meeting some friends on Saturday. We are going to try a new restaurant. On Sunday, I will probably stay home and prepare for next week.": "/audio/tts/17e0043890f0ac625bf0.mp3?v=1",
  "I enjoy reading and taking photos. I can play chess, but I can't swim very well. Today it is sunny, so my friends are playing football outdoors.": "/audio/tts/ec2d3caaf457cfe89565.mp3?v=1",
  "I have studied English for one year. I attend class twice a week and have to complete homework online. I must practise regularly, but I don't have to study at the same time every day.": "/audio/tts/33f3f7c1c68373c04d82.mp3?v=1",
  "I recently compared two phone plans. The cheaper one had fewer benefits and might have included extra fees. I chose the clearer plan because it offered better value for money and flexible cancellation.": "/audio/tts/7b472e6de52f814aed39.mp3?v=1",
  "I recently saw a play that a friend had recommended. She said the acting was excellent. I used to prefer films, but I have been attending more live performances this year.": "/audio/tts/fa34622f5a16fb22a1da.mp3?v=1",
  "I usually read news on trusted websites. Social media is convenient; however, some posts are misleading. People should compare several sources and look for evidence.": "/audio/tts/0b82f9c13c4a6fb0a05b.mp3?v=1",
  "I usually shop at a market near my home. I buy vegetables, eggs and some rice. In a café, I say: Can I have a tea and a sandwich, please?": "/audio/tts/3aa38c5ae4938aabd3c5.mp3?v=1",
